<title>USA: MFB names Hums as new chairman.</title>
<headline>MFB names Hums as new chairman.</headline>
<dateline>MISHAWAKA, Ind. 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>MFB Corp said it elected Thomas Hums as chairman of the board.</p>
<p>He succeeds Marian &quot;Kirk&quot; Torian, who had served since the company's formation in March 1994.</p>
<p>MFB is the parent of MFB Financial.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
</text>
